Once I'm tough enough to handle water nymphs and water demons I usually
drink from every fountain I find in case it is magic. Drop all your
items first so they don't get cursed. You can easily get +4 or +5 to
all stats if you try every fountain in the DoD. I think maxing out
stats (not charisma) is an important early-mid game goal. And hey, you
might even get a wish.

